msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"As long as you're being so hospitable, why don't you just tell me where "
"Gohren is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "He's got his men together up on the roof of the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"The Millennium Tower roof? That's just above the Kazama Family Office. "
"There's no way they could've pulled that off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"The best place to hide is right under somebody's nose. Several Reapers are "
"former members of the Kazama Family. They could get the keys no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"It's time they headed out to storm the HLA. If you wanna go, better make it "
"fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "If you're in a hurry to die, that is. Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "(Dammit... I better get to the Millennium Tower, fast.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Everybody's meeting up at midnight. If you get there at the right time, you "
"oughta be able to see Gohren-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "If you're in a hurry to die, that is. Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"(No point in going to the Millennium Tower if Gohren's not there yet... "
"I'll wait until midnight.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Who the hell are you!? What happened to the guards!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "They're taking a little rest out front."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Get the fuck outta here, man. You⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "I'm with the Honest Living Association. I'm here to see Gohren."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "You idiot! Gohren-san ain't here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"He already left for the attack on the HLA. Probably givin' all his men a "
"pep talk right about now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"He already left for the attack on the HLA. He'll be gettin' his men "
"together for a nice pep talk tonight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "I see. No reason for me to be here, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Whoa! Just a minute, pal. Not so fast. Why don't ya stay a while?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Let us show ya a bit of our hospitality!"
msgstr ""

